package itest

/*
Two zones signed internally, with keys nothing public vouches for (issue #226):
a private reverse zone and a routed forward zone. Each case anchors its zone
beside the root, so an answer from it validates only if the chain walk starts
at that anchor - AD on the reply is the proof, where SERVFAIL would be equally
"validated and failed" and "never reached the zone".

Generated - `testdata/gen/sign_fixtures.py`, scenario `anchored_internal_zones`.
*/

